# Study African Music in Bamako, Mali

It's been 5 years! And finally [Nathaniel](/about/) will be returning to study African music in Bamako, Mali, West Africa. Flying out on January 14th, with 24 hours in the air, he will spend one month training Djembe, Balafon and Dundun with Bassidi Koné and Bwazan. What a way to start the New Year! Nathaniel will also be visiting the [Bwazan Association's](http://bwazan-mali.com/) Music School in Bamako, Mali. This is where all of your generous donations have been going over the past year. We are really looking forward to meeting the artists and children and we are promising photos and videos on Nathaniel's return. Nathaniel will be back in February and ready to share some awesome new material for 2018 folks! It's going to be a good one!
